			"notes": "# 🛸 Drone Works – v1.0\n\n**Drone Works** is a Minecraft Fabric 1.21.8 mod that adds **autonomous farming drones**.  \nHarvest **carrots, wheat, potatoes, and beets** automatically and deposit items into a linked **Station**.\n\n---\n\n## 🌾 Features\n- Automatic harvesting in a **10-block radius**  \n- Drones deposit crops into a **Station** (Hopper compatible)  \n- Customizable with **16 Paint Bomb colors**  \n- Easy crafting using the **Box Block**  \n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Installation\n1. Install **Fabric Loader 1.21.8**  \n2. Install **Fabric API**  \n3. Place `DroneWorks-1.0.jar` in `.minecraft/mods/`  \n4. Launch Minecraft and enjoy automated farming\n\n---\n\n## 🧩 Crafting & Usage\n1. Craft drones in a **Box Block** using: Antenna, 2 Propellers, Casing, Battery, Core, and optional Paint Bomb  \n2. Place a **Station** and link your drone to start harvesting  \n\n---\n\n## 📥 Download\n- GitHub: [Drone Works v1.0.0](https://github.com/xen0r-star/DroneWorks)  \n- Modrinth: [Drone Works v1.0.0](https://modrinth.com/mod/drone-works)"
